          {
            "name": "kLoopBudget",
            "type": "u32",
            "value": 2000000000,
            "help": "The loop guard of the logic the game's Blueprints run in (Runtime::budget: loop passes in one step). The functions the game calls loop long - a code encoded bit by bit, a sound sample by sample, a number raised to a 256-bit power -, so the game and its tests set the guard to this.",
            "const": true
          }
        ],
        "library": true,
